    "description": "Summary of observed and expected 95\\% CL upper limits on the production cross-section of $\\sigma(pp\\to X\\to SH)$ in fb in the combination of $WW$+$ZZ$, and in the $WW$ and $ZZ$ individual channels. The best expected limit is set to 85 fb for $m_{X}$ = 1250 GeV and $_{S}$ = 300 GeV. The combination limits gain about 26--53% over the best individual limit from the $WW1\\ell2\\tau_{\\mathrm{had}}$ channel.",
